221
00:07:52,774 --> 00:07:54,798
It found no indication that the date

222
00:07:54,798 --> 00:07:56,814
was chosen for the eclipse.

223
00:07:57,044 --> 00:07:59,466
The plane cost about twenty-six thousand

224
00:07:59,466 --> 00:08:01,277
nine hundred dollars.

225
00:08:01,517 --> 00:08:04,417
Some lawmakers still want more.

226
00:08:04,417 --> 00:08:06,202
In twenty twenty-five,

227
00:08:06,202 --> 00:08:09,308
a House bill proposed a full independent

228
00:08:09,308 --> 00:08:11,093
