230
00:08:13,047 --> 00:08:14,857
It is a proposal.

231
00:08:14,957 --> 00:08:17,224
As far as the official record we

232
00:08:17,224 --> 00:08:17,882
could check,

233
00:08:17,882 --> 00:08:19,843
it has not become law.

234
00:08:20,084 --> 00:08:21,994
Let me draw the vault.

235
00:08:21,994 --> 00:08:23,665
Forty-two compartments,

236
00:08:23,665 --> 00:08:25,234
each one sealed.

237
00:08:25,234 --> 00:08:26,295
Every year,

238
00:08:26,295 --> 00:08:28,134
