247
00:08:41,850 --> 00:08:44,438
What if the government simply updated the

248
00:08:44,438 --> 00:08:45,254
price?

249
00:08:50,917 --> 00:08:52,087
On paper,

250
00:08:52,087 --> 00:08:53,887
the gap is huge.

251
00:08:53,997 --> 00:08:56,582
Booked at the market price of September

252
00:08:56,582 --> 00:08:57,968
