259
00:09:14,584 --> 00:09:16,984
Some proposals go further.

260
00:09:16,984 --> 00:09:19,501
A Senate bill introduced in twenty

261
00:09:19,501 --> 00:09:20,394
twenty-five,

262
00:09:20,394 --> 00:09:21,515
the BITCOIN Act,

263
00:09:21,515 --> 00:09:23,575
would have the Treasury issue new gold

264
00:09:23,575 --> 00:09:26,069
