265
00:09:26,069 --> 00:09:28,586
partly to help fund a national bitcoin

266
00:09:28,586 --> 00:09:29,534
reserve.

267
00:09:29,534 --> 00:09:30,370
Again,

268
00:09:30,370 --> 00:09:31,783
