269
00:09:31,783 --> 00:09:32,960
not law.

270
00:09:33,217 --> 00:09:35,397
Here is the catch.

271
00:09:35,397 --> 00:09:38,367
Revaluing the gold does not create a

272
00:09:38,367 --> 00:09:40,287
