276
00:09:48,757 --> 00:09:51,277
Supporters see a hidden asset.

277
00:09:51,507 --> 00:09:53,825
Critics see printing money with extra

278
00:09:53,825 --> 00:09:54,657
steps.

279
00:09:54,967 --> 00:09:56,014
Either way,

280
00:09:56,014 --> 00:09:58,967
