282
00:10:00,350 --> 00:10:03,160
And it is a lot of gold.

283
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:05,919
According to World Gold Council figures,

284
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:07,438
based on IMF data,

285
00:10:07,438 --> 00:10:09,419
China holds around two thousand three

286
00:10:09,419 --> 00:10:11,598
hundred and eighty-seven tonnes,

287
00:10:11,598 --> 00:10:14,020
and Russia about two thousand two hundred

288
00:10:14,020 --> 00:10:15,500
and seventy.

289
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:17,089
By our calculation,

290
00:10:17,089 --> 00:10:19,432
the United States holds about three point

291
00:10:19,432 --> 00:10:21,735
